  {
   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"Nimbusfield Security was compliant with all three financial covenants for the period ended October 31, 2026, and the compliance certificate agrees with the bank's calculations in each case. The most important development is a high-severity runway signal. Calculated runway is {{fact:c746b4ed-8d18-4439-8674-1ff42a1f6bee}} months against a covenant floor of {{fact:630c254d-1471-4fb0-8e22-60bc5dc8ed50}}, and the system reports that headroom on both the runway and unrestricted cash covenants has declined since August. The related work item has been acknowledged, and no open items await a decision this period.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Minimum Runway was met at {{fact:c746b4ed-8d18-4439-8674-1ff42a1f6bee}} months against a required {{fact:630c254d-1471-4fb0-8e22-60bc5dc8ed50}}, a cushion of {{fact:8775773d-469c-4c44-b02b-bade3d4452b3}}. Minimum Unrestricted Cash was met at {{fact:e53ca936-67bd-4911-accb-2b7340013477}} against a required {{fact:b9b02449-0279-4f33-b9bb-4cf4e737fcaa}}, a cushion of {{fact:22dc8874-a5ff-4b77-812d-7550cf39f087}}. Revenue to Plan was met at {{fact:8a27379c-e6c9-4471-bbc9-18c9b4bc6883}} against a required {{fact:826cdbf2-11da-4955-be7c-8c70b9d676c4}}, a cushion of {{fact:3e767099-3ffd-499e-a3de-6ac1fec713a9}}. The certificate reports {{fact:8e276e69-4534-418a-b7d6-a16d6bc0a9ce}}, {{fact:8f53d264-908b-440b-81f8-062f5dbac10e}} and {{fact:12284ab4-7733-4f88-9a27-6d6afb58f230}} respectively, which match the bank's calculations.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"The high-severity runway-below-watch signal is the main concern. Runway is {{fact:c746b4ed-8d18-4439-8674-1ff42a1f6bee}} months against a covenant floor of {{fact:630c254d-1471-4fb0-8e22-60bc5dc8ed50}}. Low-severity signals show headroom falling since August on the runway covenant, now {{fact:8775773d-469c-4c44-b02b-bade3d4452b3}}, and on the unrestricted cash covenant, now {{fact:22dc8874-a5ff-4b77-812d-7550cf39f087}}. A headroom signal also fired on Revenue to Plan, but revenue remains above the floor. The August comparison values, burn rate and watch threshold are not among the facts provided, and a reviewer may wish to confirm them. The high-severity work item has been acknowledged, and no items remain open.\"}]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
 ],
